{"id":"n80822-1-9","stage":4,"title":"침입 · 入侵","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80822-1-9-1","ko":"이 컴퓨터, 왜 이렇게 속도가 느려?","zh":"这台电脑，为什么速度这么慢啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컴퓨터,","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속도가","meaning":"速度","explanation":"속도：速度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속도","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64215","senseId":"1","lemma":"속도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느려?","meaning":"慢，缓慢，迟缓","explanation":"느리다：慢，缓慢，迟缓；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"느리다","audio":"/audio/fefab822c00f5a651f89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23143","senseId":"1","lemma":"느리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c03f7e871a4127c4","term":"속도","zh":"速度","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3","entryId":"64215","definition":"物体移动或事情进行的快慢。","pronunciation":["속또"]},{"id":"fefab822c00f5a65","term":"느리다","zh":"慢，缓慢，迟缓","audio":"/audio/fefab822c00f5a651f89.mp3","entryId":"23143","definition":"做某个行为所用的时间长。","pronunciation":["느리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/19b8f9e24d520fc4ea27.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80822-1-9-2","ko":"어제 바이러스의 침입을 받은 것 같아.","zh":"好像是昨天被病毒入侵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바이러스의","meaning":"病毒，电脑病毒","explanation":"바이러스：病毒，电脑病毒；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"바이러스","audio":"/audio/38b5772e1520b3dded97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15813","senseId":"2","lemma":"바이러스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"침입을","meaning":"入侵，闯入","explanation":"침입：入侵，闯入；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"침입","audio":"/audio/ddd207c7581d6648f361.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80822","senseId":"1","lemma":"침입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받은","meaning":"受到，遭到，得到","explanation":"받다：受到，遭到，得到；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"7","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"38b5772e1520b3dd","term":"바이러스","zh":"病毒，电脑病毒","audio":"/audio/38b5772e1520b3dded97.mp3","entryId":"15813","definition":"导致电脑不能正常工作的程序。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ddd207c7581d6648","term":"침입","zh":"入侵，闯入","audio":"/audio/ddd207c7581d6648f361.mp3","entryId":"80822","definition":"侵占他人的土地、国家、权利、财产等。","pronunciation":["치ː밉"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"受到，遭到，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"某一情况涉及到自己。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3467ac596ed74566273.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80822","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好像是昨天被病毒入侵了。","因为白天喝了咖啡，所以一整晚都睡不着。","这台电脑，为什么速度这么慢啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好像是昨天被病毒入侵了。","这台电脑，为什么速度这么慢啊？","因为白天喝了咖啡，所以一整晚都睡不着。"],"answer":0}]}
